# Play test of Geiger Isle (CIPlay geiger_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the jetty and its crate, through the
# gate into the fenced yard, the warning sign, the guard's hut, the crate in the yard, into the bunker and its locker.
# Points as in its recipe.
island Geiger Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Hyena 2
expect animals Rat 3
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Hyena
kill Rat
kill Roach
# Along the jetty to its head, the crate
walk 0 -44 to 0 -50 to 0 -55 h=1.5 below=4
open Crate on the jetty
# Up the track, the warning sign by the gate
walk 0 -38 to 0 -30 h=2.4 below=5
at -4.5 -23
read Warning sign
# Through the gate: the guard's hut, the yard's crate
walk 0 -21 to -8.75 -18 to -8.75 -15 h=3.3 below=5
expect stand -8.75 -15 h=3.3 below=5
open Guard's box
walk -4 -14 to 2 -13 h=3 below=5
open Crate in the yard
# North through the fence's gap into the bunker
walk 0 4 to -1 10 to -1 16 to -1 26 h=3.1 below=5
expect stand -1 26 h=3.1 below=5
open Bunker locker
dig
